{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.LagrangeResolventCyclicEigenvalue","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.LagrangeResolventCyclicEigenvalue","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.colourResolvent_cyclic_eigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.colourResolvent_cyclic_eigenvalue","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LagrangeResolventCyclicEigenvalue.lean#L48-L54","doc":"**Cube-root (colour-channel) specialization.** For `w³ = 1` the same identity\nholds for the length-3 resolvent — the trefoil colour channel's S₃ sub-DFT,\nwhose stabilizer phase is `ζ₃ = e^{2πi/3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.lagrangeResolvent_cyclic_eigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.lagrangeResolvent_cyclic_eigenvalue","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/LagrangeResolventCyclicEigenvalue.lean#L36-L46","doc":"**Cyclic eigenvalue of the Lagrange resolvent.** For `w` a formal 5th root of\nunity (`w⁵ = 1`), the cyclic shift `x_j ↦ x_{j+1}` multiplies the k-th resolvent\n`w_k = x₀ + w x₁ + w² x₂ + w³ x₃ + w⁴ x₄` (with `w = ζ₅^k`) by `w`:\n`w · (shift · w_k) = w_k`. Hence the resolvent is an eigenvector of the shift\nwith eigenvalue `w⁻¹ = ζ₅^{-k}` — the offset angle is the stabilizer root of\nunity. ","signatureChunk":0}]}